Message-ID: <Pine.OSF.4.31.0101101206230.218405-100000@aloha.nascom.nasa.gov>
Date: Wed, 10 Jan 2001 11:10:21 -0600
From: Amy
Subject: Re: broken tape in TZ87?

On Wed, 10 Jan 2001, Ron Farrer wrote:

> Amy (amy@aloha.nascom.nasa.gov) wrote:
